       "text": "I haven't entered this order. 10,000 mg three times daily comes to 30 g/day, which is several times the maximum recommended acetaminophen dose of 4 g/day for adults. A single 10 g dose is already in the range that risks serious hepatotoxicity, even with normal liver function.\n\nDid you mean **1,000 mg** by mouth three times daily (3 g/day)? If so, I can enter that right away.\n\nHere are other common regimens:\n- 650 mg PO every 6 hours (2.6 g/day)\n- 1,000 mg PO every 8 hours (3 g/day)\n- 1,000 mg PO every 6 hours (4 g/day, the maximum)\n\nTell me which dose you want. If 10,000 mg really is what you intend, please confirm that explicitly and give the clinical rationale. I would still be very hesitant to enter it."
